WEBVTT

00:04:59.663 --> 00:05:00.913
is not new.

00:05:01.704 --> 00:05:03.871
But this moment is.

00:05:04.454 --> 00:05:05.996
And if I have learned one thing

00:05:05.996 --> 00:05:09.538
since starting out
as a young economist years ago,

00:05:09.538 --> 00:05:11.496
whether I was working with Pattan elders

00:05:11.538 --> 00:05:14.454
to improve the lives
of farmers in Pakistan,

00:05:14.454 --> 00:05:17.954
or navigating the controversies
of building colossal dams,

00:05:17.996 --> 00:05:21.788
it's that systems don't change systems;

00:05:21.829 --> 00:05:23.496
people change systems.

00:05:24.038 --> 00:05:25.788
And whether you're a prime minister,

00:05:25.829 --> 00:05:27.954
a paramedic or a protestor on the street,

00:05:27.996 --> 00:05:30.538
you can choose to change this one.